		(at 147.84 75)
		(descr "Huber+Suhner 85_QLA-01-0-2/112_NE (item 22640039), QLA-01 right-angle PCB jack, intermateable with LEMO 00.250. Mounting hole ML 97 (drawing 4.13.03371_1 c): 5 x dia 1.1 mm, centre + 4 legs on 5.08 mm square. Catalogue drawing 3.13.02550.1 d: centre pin dia 0.92, legs 0.9, body 7 x 7 x 7 mm, axis 3.5 mm above PCB, front face 14 mm from pin centre, 17.5 mm overall. Nose points to +Y. Pin 1 = centre (signal), 4 legs = pad 2 (GND).")
